{
  "$comment": "Motion tokens for the replica. Durations in ms. confidence: measured = read from footage or the original's own statements; observed = described in writing by players or reviewers without numbers, so the duration is tuned to the description; estimate = no source, a starting value to tune by eye. Easings name the tokens in tokens.css (ease-out, ease-in-out, ease-pop, ease-in) or give a literal. The original has no idle shimmer: finishes move only with the pointer or the device.",
  "springs": {
    "$comment": "The tilt driver in components/bundle.js. Per frame: v += (target - x) * k; v *= 1 - d; x += v. follow runs while a pointer is down or hovering; release runs after it lifts. The original smooths tilt with a spring-damper controller with added response delay; these constants reproduce that lag by eye.",
    "follow": { "k": 0.12, "d": 0.32, "confidence": "estimate" },
    "release": { "k": 0.035, "d": 0.18, "confidence": "estimate" },
    "gyro": {
      "clampDeg": 16,
      "relativeToActivation": true,
      "activeGain": 1.5,
      "confidence": "estimate"
    },
    "idleShimmer": false,
    "reducedMotionPose": {
      "--pd-pointer-x": "35%",
      "--pd-pointer-y": "30%",
      "--pd-from-center": 0.5,
      "--pd-active": 0.6,
      "--pd-tilt-x": -0.3,
      "--pd-tilt-y": -0.4
    }
  },
  "tokens": {
